1
00:00:00,002 --> 00:00:01,712
(Sheldon:)So, tomorrow?

2
00:00:03,105 --> 00:00:05,055
(Stuart:)I don't mean to be rude,
Sheldon, but,

3
00:00:05,207 --> 00:00:07,207
(Stuart:)my life is kind of
falling apart right now.

4
00:00:07,376 --> 00:00:08,646
(Sheldon:)Your life?

5
00:00:08,811 --> 00:00:11,351
(Sheldon:)The university is making me
do string theory,

6
00:00:11,514 --> 00:00:14,894
(Sheldon:)and my girlfriend loves me
so much she wants to live with me.

7
00:00:16,319 --> 00:00:20,559
(Sheldon:)And now, the place I need to go when
I'm sad is damp and smells funny.

8
00:00:22,625 --> 00:00:24,465
(Stuart:)Well, sorry I let you down.

9
00:00:24,627 --> 00:00:27,237
(Sheldon:)No, I do not accept this.

10
00:00:27,396 --> 00:00:29,566
(Sheldon:)Everything is changing and I hate it.

11
00:00:29,732 --> 00:00:32,402
(Sheldon:)It stops now. I'm helping you
get back on your feet.

12
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,344
(Sheldon:)I would like to purchase
this comic book, please.

13
00:00:39,475 --> 00:00:40,685
(Stuart:)That'll be $2.99.

14
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:43,413
(Sheldon:)Really? it's soaking wet.

15
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,480
(Stuart:)Fine, a dollar.

16
00:00:48,884 --> 00:00:51,694
-Can you break a 20?
-No, I only have hundreds.

17
00:00:53,723 --> 00:00:55,363
(Raj:)You know what?

18
00:00:55,524 --> 00:00:57,834
(Sheldon:)I don't always recognize sarcasm,
but I do right now,

19
00:00:57,993 --> 00:01:00,023
(Sheldon:)and I don't appreciate it.

